# Presentation working copy. The numbered markdown files and the diagrams are
# COPIES - the originals live in docs/claude_pipeline/outputs/ and
# docs/diagrams/rendered/, and duplicating them in history helps nobody.
#
# The three files that exist only here ARE tracked, because losing them would
# mean losing work: the entry-point note, the HTML script the team films from,
# and the teammate setup guide.
VIDEO PRESENTATION DOCS/*
!VIDEO PRESENTATION DOCS/!! READ THIS FIRST - SEAN.md
!VIDEO PRESENTATION DOCS/filming-script.html
!VIDEO PRESENTATION DOCS/SET UP LOYDS LAPTOP.md
!VIDEO PRESENTATION DOCS/PASTE THIS INTO LOYDS CLAUDE.md

# vite writes these beside the config during a build; they are not source
vite.config.ts.timestamp-*
